  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ミミモチシダ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9F%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A2%E3%83%81%E3%82%B7%E3%83%80",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 107303117,
      "text": "ミミモチシダは、熱帯系のシダ植物の一つ。大きな小葉を持つ大柄なシダで、マングローブの湿地に生育する。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Acrostichum aureum",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acrostichum_aureum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1350967201,
      "text": "Acrostichum aureum, the golden leather fern, is a large species of fern that grows in mangrove swamps and other wet locations. Other common names include swamp fern and mangrove fern."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Acrostichum aureum",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acrostichum_aureum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 231166818,
      "text": "Acrostichum aureum, l'Acrostic doré, Fougère à canards ou Fougère dorée, est une espèce de fougères de la famille des Pteridaceae, se développant dans les mangroves."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Acrostichum aureum",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acrostichum_aureum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 72740714,
      "text": "A Acrostichum aureum, conhecida popularmente como samambaia-do-mangue é uma erva pteridófita da ordem Polypodiales, família Pteridaceae., e do gênero Acrostichum, nativa do Brasil."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Paku laut",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paku_laut",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 26105428,
      "text": "Paku laut adalah sejenis paku-pakuan berukuran besar, yang biasa tumbuh di tanah di bawah naungan hutan bakau atau lahan basah lainnya. Paku atau pakis ini juga dikenal dengan banyak nama lain seperti paku larat, papah, piai, paku hata diuk (Sunda), warakas, krakas, kakakeok (Jawa), dan rewayang (Halmahera). Nama-namanya dalam bahasa Inggris di antaranya golden leather fern, swamp fern, dan mangrove fern."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "cultivation": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Acrostichum aureum § Cultivation",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acrostichum_aureum#Cultivation",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1350967201,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "Golden leather fern can be grown under high light in garden soil or potting mix, if the substrate is kept constantly wet. Ordinary fresh water (not brackish water) is sufficient for cultivation.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "fr": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Acrostichum aureum § Culture",
        "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acrostichum_aureum#Culture",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 231166818,
        "heading": "Culture",
        "text": "La Fougère dorée se développe bien dans un milieu ensoleillé et très humide, par exemple près des étangs ou des marécages. La pluviométrie annuelle de son aire de répartition est relativement importante (1000 à 2000 mm de précipitations annuelles). Elle est vulnérable à de forts déficits hydriques.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    },
    "uses": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Acrostichum aureum § Uses",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acrostichum_aureum#Uses",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1350967201,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "In Cambodia, where the fern is known as prâng' tük (prâng'=\"cycad\", tük=\"aquatic\", Khmer language), the young leaves are eaten in salads.\nIn the Indian state of Goa, the fern crosiers (young fiddleheads) are cooked in a spicy coconut-based gravy known as tonak and consumed as a delicacy by the local people.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Paku laut § Manfaat",
        "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paku_laut#Manfaat",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 26105428,
        "heading": "Manfaat",
        "text": "Daun-daun paku laut yang dikeringkan dipergunakan sebagai atap rumah. Pucuknya yang muda juga dimanfaatkan sebagai sayuran di beberapa daerah. Daun-daun yang tua dan juga akarnya digunakan sebagai bahan obat tradisional.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
